OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of violent disorder
OL,4,Aafter street fight
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been found guilty of violent
OL,7,Fdisorder following a street fight
OL,8,Finvolving people armed with wooden
OL,9,Fplanks and poles.
OL,11,FAt Sheffield Crown Court on Tuesday,
OL,12,FTeodor Mizigar, 19 and of Hollings
OL,13,FRoad, Bradford, was convicted for his
OL,14,Frole in the brawl in Firth Park Road in
OL,15,FSheffield on 2 February.
OL,17,FMilan Mizigar, 24 and of Apley Road,
OL,18,FDoncaster, and a 17-year-old boy, who
OL,19,Fcannot be named due to his age, both
OL,20,Fpleaded guilty to violent disorder in
OL,21,FJuly.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
